<author id="830549">haukex</author>
<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;As with [id://11118407|the other post] today, in a piped [doc://open], [doc://close] needs to be checked for errors as well. Or, let me just plug my relatively new module [mod://IPC::Run3::Shell::CLIWrapper] &lt;c&gt;;-)&lt;/c&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
use JSON::PP qw/decode_json/;
use IPC::Run3::Shell::CLIWrapper;

my $geoip = IPC::Run3::Shell::CLIWrapper-&gt;new( { fail_on_stderr=&gt;1,
	stdout_filter =&gt; sub {$_=decode_json($_)} }, qw/ geoip --json
	--DB=dbi:SQLite:dbname=geoipdb / );

my $data = $geoip-&gt;('209.197.123.153');
&lt;/c&gt;</doctext>
